  "body": "This 1,212m2 freehold property is in a prime location mid-way down the Peninsula.\r\n\r\nPositioned less than 100 metres from Little Manly Beach, this property will be perfect for water sports enthusiasts, and for a coastal holiday lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet well back from the road, the north-west facing home gets fantastic sunlight and offers good privacy, and a calm outlook.\r\n\r\nThe house is ready for someone with vision — you can renovate, rebuild or look into development options (with council approval). The site gives you plenty of room to plan for the future.\r\n\r\nThe location is a real highlight. Beaches, cafés, schools, Coast Plaza and public transport are all close by. With the area growing fast and the Penlink connection on the way, this is a great place to buy.\r\n\r\nHomes with this mix of position and potential are getting harder to find. A solid choice for buyers who want a fantastic lifestyle plus good long-term value.",
